<!--Post: 10743--><!--Time: 1110176236-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10743"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bluepup<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bluepup<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 10:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This board has gone to hell since the arrest of Dennis Rader. Seems like some people cannot accept that they didn&#39;t provide the &#34;link&#34; that led to his capture and so they go on and on... making lists and timelines, etc.  - like WPD, KBI and FBI aren&#39;t doing the same thing or are way ahead of them. It would almost be funny if it wasn&#39;t so stupid.  <BR>Embersage, Skov and crew - stick to the ideas that can really help- like getting help for the victim&#39;s families - and leave the investigation to the professionals. Quit convincing yourselves you are helping the victim&#39;s families with your obsessions.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10743-->
<!--Post: 10751--><!--Time: 1110201899-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10751"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 5:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#40;below&#41; Bluepup&#39;s post a few minutes before the one above....  My suggestion Bluepup.... &#34;quit convincing yourself&#34; that any of your posts have an ounce of original thought. All you do is search this board for other posts and repeat them. Your post &#34;would almost be funny if it wasn&#39;t so stupid&#34;. <BR> <BR>Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 9:49 pm:      <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>weird, huh? same last name and was posted here before Dennis Rader was a suspect. &#34;To BTK&#34; page 2  <BR> <BR>Ruth Rader  <BR>Posted on Saturday, December 18, 2004 - 3:00 am:  <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------  <BR>Are you going to contact &#34;America&#39;s Most Wanted&#34; or John Walsh tonight,BTK?  <BR> <BR>He&#39;s hunting you,BTK. And you know it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10751-->
<!--Post: 10764--><!--Time: 1110220483-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10764"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 10:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Pup… Dog here. <BR> <BR>Don’t we all too long for the good old days – before the arrest. That’s when this board meant something. <BR> <BR>Admitting to myself that I had lost all self control, I tried your two step program for overcoming my obsession to post. <BR> <BR>1&#41;	Give my obsession over to a higher power <BR>2&#41;	Help the victims families <BR> <BR>So, I gave all my baggage to Law Enforcement, since they had done such a great job of sitting on evidence, waiting for somebody to make a mistake… Oh, and the way they wizzed like a racehorse into the jury pool at the “bottom line” press conference… that granted me serenity. <BR> <BR>At HateRader’s suggestion, I wrote to Oprah and Dr. Phil, because I sincerely believe the surviving victims need a safe place to tell their stories to the world. <BR>They also need a tough coach to strengthen and focus them in preparation for their one opportunity to confront the monster. <BR> <BR>ALL: Yes, the possibility of exploitation is enormous… but, the media is all over these poor souls regardless…  <BR>And since I can’t trust my milkman, my postman, my meter reader or the “Girl Scout” who brought four boxes of thin mints to my door yesterday – I’ve just got to find someone to trust. <BR>Why not Dr. Phil? <BR> <BR>I urge every poster AND reader to do the same. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.drphil.com" target=_top>http://www.drphil.com</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.oprah.com" target=_top>http://www.oprah.com</a> <BR> <BR>Blue, what other ways are there to help the victims families? <BR>You gave no suggestions or details. <BR> <BR>I ask because the two steps didn’t work for me. <BR>You see…I’M STLL   F  R  E  A  K  I  N  G    POSTING!!!! <BR> <BR>Bloop, before you or I or anyone lights a fuse disguised as a thread on this board, empathize with your fellow posters. <BR>One man’s waste of time may be another’s catharsis. <BR>Everyone who registered here knew they were going to absorb an unhealthy dose of BTK’s effluvium –  <BR>-- but who knew how they would express it from their systems once the jackass was in custody. <BR> <BR>Most who post now are looking for an answer as to how a bright, handsome, corn fed, “golden boy” evolved into an abominable beast. Study hard people, it will happen again. <BR> <BR>As for the timeliners… let ‘em rock! <BR> <BR>Recent polls at CatchBTK show a decided lack of confidence in LE’s ability to get all the goods. <BR>History shows that calculating brutes &#40;think Bundy or Henry Lee&#41; get perks and bus rides and LOTS OF ATTENTION when they practice a   s   l   o   w   reveal of their secret crimes. <BR> <BR>Rader may rot, but has BTK really been caught until all his victims see justice?      <BR> <BR>Pup, you get a pass, for what it’s worth, for your “gang flame” of a post. <BR> <BR>Emotional exorcisms are happening hourly here at Catch®. <BR>So dig up your 8 track of “Tubular Bells”, crank it to the max and have a bowl of Campbell’s split pea soup. <BR> <BR>Then come back and join the fun. <BR> <BR>Salutations from your junior safety patrol officer of the day, <BR> <BR>LawDog <BR> <BR> <BR>Lilly… I though we had gotten your temp under control girl. What with the Mojitos, the dancing and the … uh… physical therapy. Breathe with me… good… again… and ag… Sorry…can’t…breathe… I’m…LOL!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10764-->
<!--Post: 10777--><!--Time: 1110225842-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10777"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bluepup<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bluepup<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 12:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lilymarie - FYI <BR>I believe that &#34;Ruth Rader&#34; post is the only time where I quoted another post- but maybe there was one other.  <BR>I don&#39;t know why you are so defensive - I certainly wasn&#39;t referring to you or anyone else that posts occasionally or even regularly. I was referring to &#34;obsessed&#34; people that have posted over 400 times &#40;in 3 weeks&#41; and simply cannot seem to accept that WPD captured him and have delusions of grandeur by thinking that WPD/KBI/FBI needs their help to put this case together when they obviously have resources way beyond what any of us have. <BR>Sorry if this offends some but I am entitled to my opinion.  <BR> <BR>LDOG -  <BR>How I wish I had the answer on how to help them, but I don&#39;t- except to follow your lead on contacting people that can. BTW - i dont like split pea soup LOL but Tubular Bells is cool. <BR>Take care all..<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10777-->
<!--Post: 10780--><!--Time: 1110226929-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10780"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 12:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->LD your still funny, and for the 80th thousandth time. I will again explain to those of you that do not get it what we are still dong here, to Elaborate on what the other posters above me have said here goes. By the way some of us have written to Dr. Phil and Oprah to ask for help for the Vic.s families and I don&#39;t neeeeedddddd help I am happy at what I do, and if you think we are all wasting our time here, then why are you still posting yourself hmmmmmmm. <BR> <BR>Here is the point, and this is the last time I will make it, I am not crazy, My job in life is to help Victims and people with mental disorders, I personally didn&#39;t expect that we would catch btk since he was out for 30 year&#39;s, what I did expect was to help find closure for the victims, now just because Rader is in jail does not mean anyone has the answers, feels secure or has that closure, Do you not finish what you have started? we are trying to learn from our mistakes, maybe grow and help others in the furture, learn something that may stop the next killer, or find that person who has been missing and the family is still in pain becuase they have no idea what happened, We can and still have a lot to learn about this case, if you don&#39;t want to help that is fine, just leave to rest of us crazy obbessiiiiivvvvvvveeee people to our work. I have no intention of arguing with you, that isn&#39;t why Tom made the board and out of respect for his hard work, those of you who no longer want to help, as someone else said go Google Serial Killers, I am sure you can find a hundred others that need attention Thank You Sheila <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
