</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 12:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ldawg - you are incredibly funny in a twisted and I hate to admit it... attractive kind of way. Thanks for thump on the head. It was early when I read that post and I had yet to find my typical bubbly and sparkling morning personality. <BR> <BR>Sheila, Skov &amp; &#34;crew&#34; I always look forward to reading your work - and I got defensive for you. But you guys/gals can obviously take care of yourselves &#40;much more eloquently than I&#41;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
