<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10790"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 1:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Concerning BluePup <BR> <BR>In my wildest fantasy I can not imaging why a normal person/poster would give damn wether a few posters continue to resarch the BTK/Rader case, just because some of us feel that somthing does NOT ADD UPP with the BTK capture, that there might be more to it than the WPD want everyone to know. <BR> <BR>So my thought of BluePup is he is from LE who is doing his job trying to shut up the few people who are STILL putting out questions wich might shed some light on that the WPD is not quite the heroes they showed off at the &#34;BTK IS ARRESTED&#34; &#40;without a trial&#41; newsconference. And you dont like that do you? <BR> <BR>I guess we &#40;the &#34;obsessed&#34;&#41; are those exstreamly irritating &#34;pebble in the shoe&#34; kind of people who still has questions and wont just, right off, eat the clean cut sucess picture of the &#34;BTK is arrested it all over&#34; case that WPD is trying to paint. <BR> <BR>BluePup you post what you want, and I do the same. I will continue to resarch the BTK/Rader case as long as I belive I can hear som false or missing tones in the BTK/WPD/RADER symphony. <BR> <BR>I might be wrong about beliving there is more to this case that WPD want us to belive, or I might be right, time will tell... <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
