<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10792"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 1:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bluepup: I started posting here because I found other&#39;s who by their own good graces gave a damn about the victims and families.  <BR>&#34;Thank you&#34; Tom for providing a forum for those of us who new victims and their families and helping us to make sure that they were not forgotten. Bluepup: there is a very real possiblity that there are victims still out there that not even you are aware of. If it was someone you knew, wouldn&#39;t you want to know if BTK was responsible?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
