</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 1:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTW while I am at it, I don&#39;t like Obsessed people running around on threads, when they don&#39;t have anything better to do, trying to make me stop and have to explain myself, so go find someone else to bug, and If our great Leader Tom was not Obsessed with trying to solve these cases then people like you would not have a place to bug people like us. Even Ed said that there is a lot to learn and understand, and the board would not be goingany where, so what is he crazy too? I hope so I need the company<!--/Text--></td></tr>
