<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10799"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nancydrew<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nancydrew<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 1:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Okay, well you guys just let us know when all these victims&#39; families call to thank you for describing the horrible ways their loved one died OVER AND OVER.  Let me know when the Fox family calls and says &#34;Wow, your description of the crime scene for all the world to read really helps me sleep at night.&#34; <BR> <BR>Let me know when the Relford kids say &#34;We&#39;d never have caught him without the Concerned Citizens group!&#34; <BR> <BR>Drop me a line when an Otero says &#34;I love it when you debate where the semen landed on or around my loved ones.  It really helped give me closure.&#34; <BR> <BR>Listen, type away, debate away, go nuts.  SKs are fascinating subject matter.  But quit fooling yourselves that you&#39;re being such a big help.  At least come to grips with the fact that LE caught Rader NO THANKS TO MESSAGE BOARDS AND CHAT ROOMS, and that the surviving family members will hurt every day long after you&#39;ve gotten bored and moved on to the next hobby.   <BR> <BR>Heck, I&#39;ll keep reading.  Your delusions of importance amuse me to no end.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
