<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10823"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 5:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nancy: Do you think the people here have gone into more detail about the victims than the Media has?  All I have seen are links or quotes from such. <BR>Maybe you should post at AMW....they love to argue! <BR>So what if people are &#34;obsessed&#34; with Denny the Dog Catcher.  30 years is a helluva long time, don&#39;t you think? <BR> <BR>And I like split pea soup!  TA DOW!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
