<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10986"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hbtcontrol<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hbtcontrol<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 5:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK = even though Bluepop claims to be &#39;gone&#39; &#40;I think he/she already was&#41; but anyway...you are wrong, wrong wrong.  This board &#40;and others&#41; was probably one of the most important ways that BTK was caught.  BTK came, read, posted and eventually spun himself totally and completely out of control.  He did what he thought he&#39;d never do...he got sloppy. He made mistakes.  He got caught on video making a drop, he left his computer imprint on a floppy disk, he left so little to his family imagination about his true identity that it was a short leap for them to make to realize he was BTK.  And all of this was because he wanted/needed more and more publicity...and this board was letting him have his fill right until he choked on it..... <BR> <BR>So take a flying leap, Bluepup and anyone else who has anything negative to say.  The people came together to back Tom Voight and make a difference in this case...and make a difference they did.   <BR> <BR>WPD and the FBI can slap themselves on the back all they want - but the truth is they blew this case for 31 years.  They should have had Rader after Kathryn Bright was murdered.   <BR> <BR>Besides, we&#39;ll never learn the truth unless someone here digs it out - WPD will continue to play their games &#40;releasing information to &#39;special&#39; people only&#41; so go for it guys... <BR> <BR>Barbara<!--/Text--></td></tr>
