<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11041"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Yomama<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Yomama<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 8:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->well, if we are obsessed about this killer, think what kind of obsession that he developed about this board and the other boards about him...for once he found out about this and other boards he couldn&#39;t just check it out once or twice he had to keep coming back and recheck this cause people kept posting. as he discovered that some of the people posting lived close to him he had to start watching his back and wondering if someone he saw walking down the street or at the store or at work was someone that was posting here or on one of the other boards...think about it guys !!! for once in the history of serial killers  one finally had to worry about a bunch of people getting on their computers and figuring him out.  this wasn&#39;t a guy that was living out in the middle of nowhere with no axcess to computers eating bugs and living off the land , no, he was right down the street from some of you with axcess to computers all over the place...if he was watching then now he knew that so were we and on the other end of the scene i&#39;ll bet that le was checking here too if for no other reason then to get some ideas after all it had been 31 years and nothing.  even though they will probably never admit it i wouldn&#39;t doubt for one minute that the reason rader was caught &#40;finaly &#41;was that le got some ideas from here.  no, we will probably  never know for sure  but you can&#39;t tell me that they didn&#39;t check this board.  ofcourse they will want to take all the credit,  and thats fine but while they are patting each other on the back &#40;le&#41; one or more will know where they got the idea from.  thank you guys for being here and i sure hope that tom comes up with some other killer that we can terrorize !!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
