</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 7:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey ROCKY: On the thought that BLT may have spied on us &#34;obsessives&#34; &amp; posted here using &#34;the computers at the Park City library or his computer at work!&#34;: <BR> <BR>Since you live near there, can you tell us: <BR> <BR>1&#41; How many computers the library has? <BR> <BR>2&#41; What are their hours? <BR> <BR>3&#41; Oh, and by the way, how far away do you live from &#34;Denny The Dog Catchers&#34; house? <BR> <BR> <BR>Thanks, in advance, from all us &#34;obsessives&#34;! <BR> <BR>Victor<!--/Text--></td></tr>
