<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11163"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Yomama<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Yomama<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 12:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->right on nightdriver...! i just read last night that there is  between 30 to 50 serial killers out there and some estimates go as high as 500...it seems to me that instead of putting these people down you should be trying to help.  i only got on thais board aBOUT 2 WEEKS BEFORE DENNIS rader  WAS CAUGHT&#39;  NOT REALLY ENOUGH TIME TO REALLY BE ABLE TO HELP BUT SOME OF THESE PEOPLE HAVE BEEN ON THIS BOARD TRYING TO HELP  since the beginning.  if you do not like what they are saying then stay off of the board...and what is it to you how many times someone posts ???  these people are not the bad guys!!!  i am amazed at some of the thought they put into trying to help and i think they did help... my hat goes off to these wonderful people that gave their time and thought to this board...you guys are great and don&#39;t let noone tell you different...this board is like a big neighborhood watch and it spreads all over the united states and elsewhere......may God bless all of you!!!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
