</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 1:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You have been looking at to many christmas lights I believe, <BR>But there is a point to that since you brought it up The Dennis Rader that everyone thought they knew, was neat and organized and in control, Denny the Dog catcher didn&#39;t care about the christmas lights, So Dennis was slipping.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
