<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11289"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 8:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>&#34;...it increased awareness of the BTK crimes and informed the public...&#34;</i> <BR> <BR>Beautifully put, o wife of Odin. My sentiments exactly.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
