<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11386"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I kinda doubt Denny The Dog Catcher will admit to any type of info that led to his arrest. His ego is too big. Unlike.......oh...ummmmm <BR> <BR>Mrs. LD: Does this mean MR. LD can come out and play....in the tall grass......with no license.....the wind blowing thru his shiny coat???? <BR> <BR>can he....huh...huh...huh.....oh boy....oh boy.....c&#39;mon.....rrrrrrrrrrrrrrr! <BR>&#40;LD:got your omno-whatever. Descriptive, ain&#39;t I?&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11386-->
<!--Post: 11389--><!--Time: 1110652139-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11389"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><i>&#34;Unless, of course, DR himself says something about it.&#34;</i> <BR> <BR>Good point, Freya. Probably be a while before we find that out.  <BR> <BR>I don&#39;t necessarily think that this or any other site helped <i>capture</i> the man, but I do think that if there was computer evidence found of his posting then it was essentially a good thing that he was lured to the computer by his own narcissism, and a good thing that this site and some of the message boards provided fodder.  <BR> <BR>I mean, think about this; they find him through, say, the Home Depot surveillance video and the computer disk. Then posts made &#34;as&#34; BTK here, say, are found in his internet cache.  <BR> <BR>Guess I&#39;m saying, if we didn&#39;t actually help capture, in a way, we may help convict.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11389-->
<!--Post: 11390--><!--Time: 1110652567-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11390"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 10:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->sorry LD. I meant to say &#34;onom-whatevah&#34;. <BR> <BR>Steve-Huff-Stud-Man: You can throw the frisbee if you want!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11390-->
