</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 2:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Steve that is what I was saying, If he was for example at the laundry mat or 47th steet etc then found on the net a few mins later at a location, I think it can help fill in the gaps of his whereabouts, WE know he was at least reading the boards that we talking about him. And I brought the wine and cheese and crackers to the out side Picnic we are having lol<!--/Text--></td></tr>
